<title>USA: DSP Comms faces shareholder lawsuit.</title>
<headline>DSP Comms faces shareholder lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSP Communications Inc said Monday that four individuals have filed -- in a California state court -- a shareholder class action against it and several of its officers and directors.</p>
<p>DSP said the suit alleges violations of California corporate securities law in connection with forward looking statements about the company, allegedly made during the first quarter of this year.</p>
<p>The company said it believes that the complaint contains false allegations and that it will fight the lawsuit.</p>
</text>
